# Lesson HTML Style Rules

- Use clear section progression: intro -> explore -> practice -> challenge -> done.
- Keep prompts short and concrete for elementary students.
- Prefer practical contexts (time, money, sharing, route, shapes).
- Wrong options should be plausible, not random noise.
- Challenge questions may be two-step, but avoid off-syllabus logic jumps.
- Do not reveal answers before user interaction.
